## Qualified browser batch example
For inspected URLs and unique Score region, emit each completed item before later failure. Independently establish scope/resource/period/coverage; navigation/node counts prove no readiness. Visual interpretation follows result.

<!-- qualified-browser-batch -->
```javascript
globalThis.batchScores = [];
for (let page = 1; page <= 3; page++) {
  await browser.navigate('https://example.test/report?page=' + page);
  const value = await ui.getByRole('region', {name: 'Score', exact: true}).text();
  ui.assert(!value.truncated && Number.isFinite(Number(value.text)));
  batchScores.push(Number(value.text));
  log({page, score: Number(value.text)});
}
globalThis.batchTotal = batchScores.reduce((sum, value) => sum + value, 0);
log({scores: batchScores, total: batchTotal});
await ui.screenshot();
```

TestComputerScriptExamplesQualification executes this exact batch/download through QuickJS/Runtime/installed Chromium:1.4MB exact download, one export/identity, three scores, retained state and screenshot. Image metadata is not path/PNG bytes. internal/ai/computer_script.go owns execution.
